>    pronunciation.
>

I don't have the full context, but I assume the "y" would be permitted
betwen the consonants of adjacent rafsi, and not between the consonants of
any consonant pair at all, otherwise the morphology gets broken ("to
smabru" cannot be pronounced "to symabru" for example).

mi'e xorxes

